# Setup traps

- No root `package.json`. Run `client/` and `server/` separately.
- Client must have `VITE_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5001`. Restart Vite after `.env` changes or API calls 404 on port 5173.
- Local Docker Mongo: `MONGODB_URI` needs `?authSource=admin`. Keep `server/init-scripts/*.sh` as LF (CRLF skips init).
- Server npm scripts use `cross-env` for `NODE_ENV`. Do not switch them back to Unix `NODE_ENV=...`.
- Seeded admin is `admin@studysprint.com` / `admin123` (`server/fixtures/users.js`). Do not use emails from old comments.
- Do not commit `.env` or real secrets.
